@30100 = ~Mage Armor~
@30101 = ~Mage Armor
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 8 hours
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

By means of this spell, the wizard creates a magical field of force that sets the caster's base Armor Class to 6. This improves by 1 AC for every four levels of the caster, up to a minimum base Armor Class of 3 at 12th level. This armor does not hinder movement, adds no weight or encumbrance, nor does it prevent spellcasting. It lasts until successfully dispelled or until the duration runs out.~

@30110 = ~Burning Hands~
@30111 = ~Burning Hands
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Special
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Cone
Saving Throw: None

When the wizard casts this spell, a cone of searing flames shoots from the caster's fingertips towards a designated point. The caster's hands must be held so as to send forth a fan-like sheet of flames: the thumbs must touch each other and the fingers must be spread. The burning hands send out 10-foot-long jets of flame in a horizontal arc of about 60 degrees in front of the wizard. All creatures caught in the flames suffer 1d6 points of fire damage plus 1d6 for every other 2 levels of the caster, up to a maximum of 5d6.~

@30120 = ~True Strike~
@30121 = ~True Strike
(Divination)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the caster otherworldly sight, resulting in preternatural accuracy for a short period. While the spell is in effect, attack rolls are made with a +4 bonus to THAC0 and the chance to score critical hits is increased by 5%.~

@30130 = ~Shocking Grasp~
@30131 = ~Shocking Grasp
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Special

When the wizard touches a creature while this spell is in effect, an electrical charge deals 1d6 points of damage and stuns the target for 1 round. If the target makes a successful Saving Throw vs. Spell, it is not stunned. For every two extra experience levels of the caster, the creature suffers an additional 1d6 points of damage and rolls its Saving Throw at an increased -1 penalty, to a maximum of 5d6 damage and a -4 Saving Throw penalty at 9th level. The spell expires once the caster makes a successful melee attack or after 1 turn has passed. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target.~

@30140 = ~Chill Touch~
@30141 = ~Chill Touch
(Necromancy)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Special

When the caster completes this spell, a blue glow encompasses the caster's hand. This energy attacks the life force of any living creature upon which the wizard makes a successful melee attack. The touched creature suffers 1d6 points of cold damage and loses 1 point of Strength for 1 hour; a successful Saving Throw vs. Death negates the ability drain. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target, and the touch is considered to be of +1 enchantment to determine what it can hit.~

@30150 = ~Reflected Image~
@30151 = ~Reflected Image
(Illusion)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 4 rounds + 1 round every 3 levels
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard creates one illusory image of the caster that travels alongside them. The image performs all of the actions that the wizard does and seems to react normally to both physical and magical damage, so enemies cannot tell which one is real. There is a 50% chance that an attacker will attack the image and a 50% chance that the attacker will attack the caster. The image is immune to all forms of damage, but disappears if Dispel Magic or Detect Illusion is used against it, or when the spell duration runs out. This spell cannot be cast on anyone who is under the effects of Mirror Image, and multiple castings do not create additional images.~

@30160 = ~Expeditious Retreat~
@30161 = ~Expeditious Retreat
(Alteration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: 3 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

When cast, this spell provides all friendly creatures in the area with an amazing fleetness of foot. The affected creatures' movement rate is almost tripled for the duration of the spell, but the excessively unnatural speed prevents them from taking almost any other actions except for running.~

@30170 = ~Obscuring Mist~
@30171 = ~Obscuring Mist
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Long
Duration: 6 rounds
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 20-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, a misty bank of fog billows out from the designated point, obscuring all sight. Everyone within the cloud suffers a -2 penalty to attack rolls and has their line of sight halved. Anyone, inside or outside the cloud, trying to attack a creature concealed by the fog with ranged weapons does so with a -4 penalty to attack rolls. Creatures with blindsight, or that do not rely on sight, can fight within the cloud without penalties.~

@30180 = ~Dimension Jump~
@30181 = ~Dimension Jump
(Conjuration)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell transports the caster to any place within sight. When the spell is cast, a dimensional portal opens up in front of the caster, who immediately steps through. Upon passing through the portal, the caster arrives at the chosen destination. The caster always arrives at exactly the spot desired, and the dimensional door does not allow anyone or anything else to pass through. Spells about to be cast upon the wizard fail, and missiles about to hit the caster instead hit thin air.~


@30200 = ~Detect Alignment~
@30201 = ~Detect Alignment
(Divination)

Level: 1
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows the wizard to search out the feelings of all creatures within the current area. When affected by this spell, a target will briefly glow red if evil, green if good, and white if neutral. Magic resistance does not affect this spell.~

@30210 = ~Battering Ram~
@30211 = ~Battering Ram
(Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Medium
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature or object
Saving Throw: Special

This spell creates a ram-like force that can strike with considerable power. The force can be used to open or smash locked, held, or wizard-locked doors, as well as locked boxes or chests, but it does not raise barred gates or similar impediments. If used against a creature, the target suffers 2d6 points of crushing damage and must save vs. Breath to avoid being knocked unconscious for 1 round.~

@30220 = ~Strength~
@30221 = ~Strength
(Alteration)

Level: 2
Range: Short
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Application of this spell sets the Strength of the character to 18 and then adds 50 exceptional Strength on top of this. The character receives any Strength bonuses appropriate. For example, if a character has between 18/50 and 18/00 Strength, then their Strength will be set to 18/00. If a character has a Strength between 18/01 and 18/50, then their Strength will become 18/50 plus the original percentage. If their Strength is less than 18, then it will become 18/50. However, this spell will actually lower a character's Strength if it is already 19 or more.~

@30230 = ~Ghoul Touch~
@30231 = ~Ghoul Touch
(Necromancy)

Level: 2
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: Death partial

When the caster completes this spell, a red glow encompasses the caster's hand. On a successful touch, the spell inflicts 1d8 points of magic damage and paralyzes the target for 5 rounds unless a successful Saving Throw vs. Death at a -1 penalty is made. The wizard gains a +4 bonus to hit the target, and the touch is considered to be of +1 enchantment to determine what it can hit.~

@30240 = ~Power Word Sleep~
@30241 = ~Power Word Sleep
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 2
Range: Long
Duration: 5 rounds
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

When a wizard utters this power word, a comatose slumber comes upon one creature. Creatures with 20 or more Hit Points can save vs. Spell to avoid the effect, but creatures with 1 to 19 Hit Points are powerless to resist. Elves and half-elves are particularly resistant to sleep effects, while undead and certain other creatures such as dragons and elementals are completely immune to magically induced sleep.~

@30250 = ~Sound Burst~
@30251 = ~Sound Burst
(Evocation)

Level: 2
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Target and enemies within 10 ft.
Saving Throw: Breath partial

This spell blasts an area with a tremendous cacophony. Enemies within the area suffer 4d4 points of crushing damage and are deafened for 1 turn. A successful Saving Throw vs. Breath at a -2 penalty halves the damage and negates the deafness. Deafened spellcasters have a 50% chance to miscast any spell. This deafness can be removed by Dispel Magic or Cure Disease.~

@30260 = ~Resist Elements~
@30261 = ~Resist Elements
(Abjuration)

Level: 2
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the recipient's resistance to all forms of elemental damage is increased by 25%. This effect lasts for the duration of the spell or until dispelled. Multiple castings of this spell are not cumulative.~


@30300 = ~Clairvoyance~
@30301 = ~Clairvoyance
(Divination)

Level: 3
Range: Personal
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the caster an unnatural perception of things to come. For the duration of the spell, the caster receives instantaneous warnings of impending danger and cannot be surprised or backstabbed. In addition, the caster gains a +2 bonus to Armor Class and a +2 bonus to Saving Throws vs. Breath. Clairvoyance cannot be dispelled.~

@30310 = ~Hold Person~
@30311 = ~Hold Person
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Target and enemies within 5 ft.
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell holds one or more humans, demihumans, or humanoid creatures rigidly immobile and in place for 1 turn. The effect is centered on the target selected by the caster, and every enemy within 5 ft. is also affected. Those who make a successful Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty are unaffected. Undead creatures cannot be held by this spell.

Held creatures cannot move or speak, but they remain aware of events around them and are helpless to change them. Being held does not stop any worsening of their condition due to wounds, disease, or poison.~

@30320 = ~Dire Charm~
@30321 = ~Dire Charm
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell functions in the same manner as Charm Person, but the target receives no bonus to the Saving Throw and the enchantment lasts longer. Dire Charm affects a single human, demihuman, or humanoid of man-size or smaller. If the target fails a Saving Throw vs. Spell, the creature regards the caster as a trusted friend and ally and will obey the caster's commands.

If the caster harms or attempts to harm the charmed creature by some overt action, or if the charm is successfully dispelled, the effect ends. If two or more charm effects affect the same creature at once, the most recent charm takes precedence.~

@30330 = ~Detect Illusion~
@30331 = ~Detect Illusion
(Divination)

Level: 3
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast at a point designated by the wizard, all hostile illusionary protections of 4th level or lower within a 30-ft. radius are dispelled. This includes Reflected Image, Blur, Invisibility, Mirror Image, Ghost Armor, Invisibility Sphere, Improved Invisibility, and Non-Detection. Magic resistance does not affect this spell.~


@30400 = ~Confusion~
@30401 = ~Confusion
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 4
Range: Long
Duration: 5 rounds + 1 round every 6 levels
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell causes confusion in one or more creatures within the area, creating indecision and the inability to take effective action. All hostile creatures within the area of effect must make a Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty. Those who save are unaffected. Those who fail will either go berserk, stand confused, or wander about for the duration of the spell. A confused creature that is attacked perceives the attacker as an enemy and acts according to its nature.~

@30410 = ~Break Enchantment~
@30411 = ~Break Enchantment
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Short
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard is able to free a creature from enchantments and curses. Break Enchantment can reverse the effects of confusion and feeblemindedness, free a victim from petrification, magical sleep, or charm, and break the effects of a curse. It does not remove a curse from a cursed shield, weapon, or suit of armor, but allows a creature afflicted by such an item to remove it. Certain special curses may require a particular caster level, ritual, or other means to counter.~

@30420 = ~Secret Word~
@30421 = ~Secret Word
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast at a target creature, it dispels one spell protection of 8th level or lower. Protections affected include Minor Spell Turning, Minor Globe of Invulnerability, Spell Immunity, Spell Deflection, Spell Turning, and Spell Shield. The target's Magic Resistance does not affect this spell.~

@30430 = ~Farsight~
@30431 = ~Farsight
(Divination)

Level: 4
Range: Personal
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

When Farsight is cast, the caster is able to view an area of an unexplored map. After casting the spell, select a section of the map to view. For the duration of the spell, the caster can observe that area and note creatures and fortifications within it.~

@30440 = ~Protection from Elemental Energy~
@30441 = ~Protection from Elemental Energy
(Abjuration)

Level: 4
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 turn/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, the recipient receives complete protection from one type of elemental damage selected by the caster: acid, cold, fire, or lightning. The chosen damage type is resisted completely for the duration of the spell. Multiple castings are not cumulative, but a different element may be selected each time.~


@30500 = ~Domination~
@30501 = ~Domination
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 5
Range: Visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell enables the caster to control the actions of one creature through a telepathic link. The target must make a Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty or remain under the caster's control for 1 turn. Unlike Mental Domination, the victim has no opportunity to break free merely because it is ordered to act against its nature.~

@30510 = ~Hold Monster~
@30511 = ~Hold Monster
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 5
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Target and enemies within 5 ft.
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell holds creatures of any type rigidly immobile and in place. The effect is centered on the selected target, and every enemy within 5 ft. is also affected. Those who make a successful Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -2 penalty are unaffected. Undead creatures cannot be held by this spell.

Held creatures cannot move or speak, but they remain aware of events around them. Being held does not prevent wounds, disease, poison, or other ongoing conditions from worsening.~

@30520 = ~Feeblemind~
@30521 = ~Feeblemind
(Enchantment/Charm)

Level: 5
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: Permanent
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: Spell negates

Feeblemind causes the subject's intellect to degenerate into that of a simple beast of burden. The victim must make a Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -4 penalty or remain feebleminded until the effect is successfully dispelled or otherwise cured.~

@30530 = ~Lower Resistance~
@30531 = ~Lower Resistance
(Abjuration)

Level: 5
Range: 40 ft.
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When cast upon a target creature, this spell lowers its Magic Resistance automatically. At 9th level the reduction is 19%. From 10th level onward the spell lowers Magic Resistance by 2% per caster level, up to a maximum reduction of 40% at 20th level. The target receives no Saving Throw and its Magic Resistance does not protect against this spell. The effect is cumulative with additional castings and cannot be dispelled.~

@30540 = ~Oracle~
@30541 = ~Oracle
(Divination)

Level: 5
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 120-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, hostile illusionary protections within a 120-ft. radius of the caster are dispelled. Oracle affects Reflected Image, Blur, Invisibility, Mirror Image, Non-Detection, Ghost Armor, Invisibility Sphere, Improved Invisibility, Shadow Door, Pixie Dust, Mislead, Project Image, and Mass Invisibility. The caster can control whom the spell affects, so allies are not stripped of their protections.~

@30550 = ~Mestil's Acid Sheath~
@30551 = ~Mestil's Acid Sheath
(Conjuration)

Level: 5
Range: Personal
Duration: 2 turns
Casting Time: 4
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell surrounds the caster with a caustic shield. While protected, the caster gains 50% resistance to acid damage. Any opponent that strikes the caster with a weapon or spell from within 5 ft. suffers 4d4 points of acid damage. Multiple castings are not cumulative, but the spell can be used together with similar magical protections. Magic resistance does not prevent the retaliatory acid damage.~


@30600 = ~Globe of Invulnerability~
@30601 = ~Globe of Invulnerability
(Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: Personal
Duration: 2 turns minimum; 1 round/level at 21st level and above
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 5-ft. radius sphere
Saving Throw: None

This spell creates an immobile, faintly shimmering magical sphere around the caster that prevents 1st-, 2nd-, 3rd-, and 4th-level spell effects from penetrating it. This includes innate abilities and effects from devices. Spells can still be cast outward from within the globe. Spells of 5th level and higher are unaffected, and appropriate higher-level magical attacks can bring the globe down. The protection lasts for at least 2 turns; at caster level 21 and above it instead lasts 1 round per level.~

@30610 = ~Power Word, Silence~
@30611 = ~Power Word, Silence
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 6
Range: 90 ft.
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When the wizard utters this power word, the target creature becomes unable to make any sound for 1 turn. This silence prevents the casting of spells that require verbal components. The effect allows no Saving Throw and can be countered by Dispel Magic or Vocalize.~

@30620 = ~Contingency~
@30621 = ~Contingency
(Universal)

Level: 6
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent until triggered
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: The caster
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, the wizard chooses one known spell to be stored and a condition that will trigger it. One spell level is allowed for every 3 caster levels, up to 6th-level spells at 18th level. When the chosen condition is met, the stored spell is cast automatically and instantaneously. The spell placed in the contingency must target the caster; offensive spells and spells targeting other party members cannot be stored.

Because Contingency belongs to the Universal school, it can be learned and cast by specialist mages regardless of their opposition school.~

@30630 = ~Banishment~
@30631 = ~Banishment
(Abjuration)

Level: 6
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 6
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

This spell forces hostile summoned creatures within the area of effect back to their proper plane or otherwise ends the magic sustaining their presence. There is no Saving Throw, and Magic Resistance does not protect against Banishment.~


@30700 = ~Protection from the Elements~
@30701 = ~Protection from the Elements
(Abjuration)

Level: 7
Range: Touch
Duration: 1 turn/2 levels
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, the recipient gains complete protection from acid, cold, electricity, and fire. Damage of these types from weapons, spells, wands, breath weapons, and other sources is resisted completely for the duration of the spell or until dispelled.~

@30710 = ~Ruby Ray of Reversal~
@30711 = ~Ruby Ray of Reversal
(Alteration)

Level: 7
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this spell is cast, it dispels one spell protection affecting the target creature, always removing the highest-level eligible protection first. If more than one protection of the same highest level is active, one is chosen at random. The exact protection-removal rules remain those of the installed spell system. Magic Resistance does not affect Ruby Ray of Reversal.~

@30720 = ~Spell Sequencer~
@30721 = ~Spell Sequencer
(Universal)

Level: 7
Range: Personal
Duration: Permanent until used
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell allows a wizard to store three spells of 4th level or lower and release them simultaneously from the Special Ability button. The sequencer remains prepared until activated. A wizard can possess only one Spell Sequencer at a time.

Because Spell Sequencer belongs to the Universal school, it can be learned and cast by specialist mages regardless of their opposition school.~

@30730 = ~Delayed Blast Fireball~
@30731 = ~Delayed Blast Fireball
(Invocation/Evocation)

Level: 7
Range: Long
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: Spell half

This spell creates a fireball that remains at the chosen point until a creature approaches closely enough to trigger it. When detonated, it explodes in a 30-ft. radius. The explosion deals at least 15d6 points of fire damage and thereafter scales with caster level up to a maximum of 20d6. Victims make a Saving Throw vs. Spell at a -4 penalty for half damage.~

@30740 = ~Power Word, Stun~
@30741 = ~Power Word, Stun
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 7
Range: Long
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 1 creature
Saving Throw: None

When this power word is uttered, one creature is stunned according to its current Hit Points:
  1-29 Hit Points: 4d4 rounds
  30-59 Hit Points: 2d4 rounds
  60-89 Hit Points: 1d4 rounds
  90 or more Hit Points: 1 round

No Saving Throw is allowed.~

@30750 = ~Summon Djinni~
@30751 = ~Summon Djinni
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 7
Range: 120 ft.
Duration: 8 rounds + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell calls a djinni from the Elemental Plane of Air to serve the caster. The summoned creature uses the abilities and statistics supplied by the installed game and mod setup. It remains under the caster's control for 8 rounds plus 1 additional round per caster level, unless slain or otherwise dismissed.~

@30760 = ~Mass Invisibility~
@30761 = ~Mass Invisibility
(Illusion/Phantasm)

Level: 7
Range: Visual range of the caster
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 7
Area of Effect: 30-ft. radius
Saving Throw: None

Upon casting this spell, all friendly creatures within a 30-ft. radius of the target point are affected by Improved Invisibility. The underlying invisibility effects and their interaction with divination magic follow the installed game and mod rules.~

@30770 = ~Limited Wish~
@30771 = ~Limited Wish
(Universal)

Level: 7
Range: Unlimited
Duration: Special
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

Limited Wish is a powerful but difficult spell that can partially alter reality according to the caster's request. The precise results depend upon the wish chosen and, in many cases, the caster's Wisdom. Existing Limited Wish dialogue choices and special interactions are preserved.

Because Limited Wish belongs to the Universal school, it can be learned and cast by specialist mages regardless of their opposition school.~

@30780 = ~Summon Death Knight~
@30781 = ~Summon Death Knight
(Necromancy)

Level: 7
Range: Medium
Duration: 3 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell calls a Death Knight, a powerful undead fiend, to the Prime Material Plane. The creature is not directly controlled and must be bound or negotiated with; an unsuccessful or abusive summoning may cause it to turn against its summoner.

The summoned Death Knight is a formidable 13-Hit-Dice warrior with strong physical and magical defenses, an aura of fear, resistance to mundane weapons and many disabling effects, and several powerful spell-like abilities. The creature remains for up to 3 turns unless slain, banished, or otherwise dismissed.~
